  "attribution": "Written by a model from the explanatory memorandum; not the record",
  "describes_version": "original",
  "as_of": "2023-11-16",
  "sentences": [
   "The bill would transfer eligible existing radiation protection licences into the proposed naval nuclear safety licensing system when that new legislative framework begins.",
   "Certain facility and source licences would be recognised under the new system to the extent that they authorise activities regulated by that framework.",
   "The bill would commence alongside the Australian Naval Nuclear Power Safety Act 2023 and would not commence if that companion legislation does not begin."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "Transferred licences would become subject to conditions under the naval nuclear safety framework.",
   "Mixed licences would remain under existing radiation protection law for activities outside the new framework.",
   "Regulations could address further matters arising from the transition between the two regulatory systems."
  ],
  "affected": "Holders of eligible facility and source licences and the radiation protection and naval nuclear safety regulators are affected.",
